> f(a: u8, b: u8) = (a & b)
> g(a: u8, b: u8) = (b & a)
> equiv f g
f and g are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
> equiv g f
g and f are equal on the domain of g (exhaustive)
> range f
range of f -> u8:
  0..255   (256 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> range g
range of g -> u8:
  0..255   (256 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 65536 points of the domain
